{"id":"f389bdba28de0478","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-redeg.md","title":"c.e. 度","display":"df-redeg — c.e. 度","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-redeg","aliases":["20-df-redeg"],"display":"df-redeg — c.e. 度","chapter":"3","section":"3.4","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§3.4；§7.3","source_pdf_pages":[96],"source_printed_pages":[60],"depends_on":["[[20-df-deg]]","[[20-df-re]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-redeg"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-redeg</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-redeg — c.e. 度"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§3.4；§7.3"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>96</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>60</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c98b19cc764c238f\" href=\"?note=c98b19cc764c238f\" title=\"20-df-deg\">20-df-deg</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c98b19cc764c238f\" href=\"?note=c98b19cc764c238f\" title=\"20-df-deg\">20-df-deg</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\)</span> 是 c.e. 度族，见上游 redeg；下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{deg}\">\\(\\mathrm{deg}\\)</span> 只区分集合族和度族。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}redeg}\\vdash\n\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}:=\\{\\deg_T(A):A\\in\\mathcal E\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{CEDegree}(\\mathbf a)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}redeg}\\vdash\n\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}:=\\{\\deg_T(A):A\\in\\mathcal E\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{CEDegree}(\\mathbf a)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是“有一个 c.e. 代表元”，不要求该等价类的每个集合都是 c.e.。集合族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R\">\\(\\mathcal R\\)</span> 与 c.e. 度族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\)</span> 名称及类型已分开。</p>\n<p>来源：§3.4；§7.3；印刷页 60；PDF 第 96 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-deg","status":"resolved","id":"c98b19cc764c238f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-deg]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-deg","status":"resolved","id":"c98b19cc764c238f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","lo